/T (The Center of Health Environment Sustainable Innovation Outreach Nutrition \(COHESION\) is a social and humanitarian foundation headquartered in Indonesia. COHESION is committed to advancing health, nutrition, education, empowerment, social protection, and environmental sustainability. The Foundation works with a broad range of stakeholders, including government and public institutions, the private sector, development partners, donors, academia, professional organizations, civil society organizations, media, communities, and local groups.)
/E (The Center of Health Environment Sustainable Innovation Outreach Nutrition \(COHESION\) is a social and humanitarian foundation headquartered in Indonesia. COHESION is committed to advancing health, nutrition, education, empowerment, social protection, and environmental sustainability. The Foundation works with a broad range of stakeholders, including government and public institutions, the private sector, development partners, donors, academia, professional organizations, civil society organizations, media, communities, and local groups.)
