/Title (The Center of Health Environment Sustainable Innovation Outreach Nutrition \(COHESION\) is a social and humanitarian foundation headquartered in Indonesia. COHESION is committed to advancing health, nutrition, education, empowerment, social protection, and environmental sustainability. The Foundation works with a broad range of stakeholders, including government and public institutions, the private sector, development partners, donors, academia, professional organizations, civil society organizations, media, communities, and local groups.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 233 0 R
/Next 382 0 R
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Title (COHESION brings together evidence, technical expertise, capacity strengthening, and collaboration to address development challenges and foster practical, sustainable solutions. Through partnerships and engagement across sectors, the Foundation supports stakeholders and communities in strengthening programmes, building institutional and community capacities, and advancing inclusive and sustainable development.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 233 0 R
/Prev 381 0 R
>>
